  "prefLabel": "Vet 901.03 Medical Records of Dental Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 901.03 Medical Records of Dental Procedures:\n\n(a) The following information shall be included in the dental chart or medical record described in Vet 701.01(b)(19):\n\n(1) A complete description of all dental, oral, or other disease present during the examination;\n\n(2) A complete description of all abnormal findings; and\n\n(3) Documentation of communication with the client with regards to any dental disease or abnormal dental findings.\n\nSource. #13657, eff 8-13-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/vet100-1000.html"
